<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Lobby: third-party notices</title>
<style>
body { font: 15px/1.5 system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 860px; margin: 2rem auto; padding: 0 1rem; }
pre { white-space: pre-wrap; background: #f4f4f4; padding: 1rem; font-size: 13px; }
li { margin: .2rem 0; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Third-party notices</h1>
<p>Lobby for Windows is built from the open-source crates below, each under the licence named.
It also embeds the Figtree font (SIL Open Font License 1.1) and Lucide icons (ISC).</p>
<h2>Licences used</h2>
<ul>
{{#each overview}}<li><a href="#{{id}}">{{name}}</a> ({{count}})</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
{{#each licenses}}
<h3 id="{{id}}">{{name}}</h3>
<p>Used by:</p>
<ul>
{{#each used_by}}<li>{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
<pre>{{text}}</pre>
{{/each}}
</body>
</html>
